@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "報表";
}

@* 版面依 docs/WEB-SPEC.md §9.6：期間列 → KPI 卡 → 圖表區 → 明細 → 簽章查詢 *@
@* 2026-07-27 改版（docs/HISTORY.md #6）：占比圖表縮小為一列三顆＋自訂圖表 modal *@

<div class="lf-card mb-3 lf-no-print">
    <div class="lf-card__body">
        <form id="report-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end">
            <div class="col-auto">
                <label for="report-from" class="form-label small mb-1">起始日期</label>
                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="report-from" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto">
                <label for="report-to" class="form-label small mb-1">結束日期</label>
                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="report-to" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">套用</button>
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto">
                <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-range="7">本週</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-range="30">本月</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-range="90">近 90 天</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto ms-auto d-flex gap-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="btn-customize-charts" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#chart-picker-modal">自訂圖表</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="btn-print-report">列印 / 存成 PDF</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<h1 class="h5 d-none d-print-block mb-3" id="print-title"></h1>

<div class="row g-3" id="report-kpi"></div>

<div class="row g-3 mt-1">
    <div class="col-lg-6" id="trend-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">告警數量趨勢</h2>
                <div id="trend-toolbar"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body">
                <div class="lf-chart" id="trend-wrapper"><canvas id="trend-chart"></canvas></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6" id="category-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">風險類型分布</h2>
                <div id="category-toolbar"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body">
                <div class="lf-chart" id="category-wrapper"><canvas id="category-chart"></canvas></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-3 mt-1">
    <div class="col-12" id="host-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <h2 class="lf-card__title mb-0">主機告警排行</h2>
                    <span class="text-muted small" id="host-rank-subtitle"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary lf-no-print d-none" id="host-view-all">查看全部</a>
                    <div id="host-toolbar"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body">
                <div class="lf-chart" id="host-wrapper"><canvas id="host-chart"></canvas></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

@* 三顆占比小圖：原本「風險層級占比」獨占一張大卡，改與新增的兩顆指標並列（#6）；
   2026-07-28（#3）圓餅圖本來就沒有 XY 軸，改左圖右文字條列，不再切換表格／下載 PNG *@
<div class="row g-3 mt-1">
    <div class="col-lg-4" id="risk-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">風險層級占比</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 align-items-center">
                <div class="lf-chart lf-chart--sm flex-shrink-0" id="risk-wrapper"><canvas id="risk-chart"></canvas></div>
                <div class="flex-grow-1" id="risk-legend"></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4" id="affected-hosts-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">受影響主機占比</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 align-items-center">
                <div class="lf-chart lf-chart--sm flex-shrink-0" id="affected-hosts-wrapper"><canvas id="affected-hosts-chart"></canvas></div>
                <div class="flex-grow-1" id="affected-hosts-legend"></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4" id="handling-progress-section">
        <section class="lf-card h-100">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">處理進度</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 align-items-center">
                <div class="lf-chart lf-chart--sm flex-shrink-0" id="handling-progress-wrapper"><canvas id="handling-progress-chart"></canvas></div>
                <div class="flex-grow-1" id="handling-progress-legend"></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="lf-card mt-3 lf-no-print">
    <div class="lf-card__header">
        <h2 class="lf-card__title">跨主機同簽章查詢</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lf-card__body">
        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            輸入 Event ID（可加來源縮小範圍），找出<strong>同一個事件簽章曾出現在哪些主機、哪些日子</strong>——
            用來判斷問題是單機個案還是全環境共通（例如同一批次更新後多台同時出現）。
            查詢範圍：您有權檢視的主機、資料保留期內的全部紀錄（<strong>不受上方報表期間限制</strong>）。
        </p>
        <form id="signature-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end mb-3">
            <div class="col-auto">
                <label for="signature-event-id" class="form-label small mb-1">Event ID</label>
                <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="signature-event-id" placeholder="153" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto">
                <label for="signature-source" class="form-label small mb-1">來源（選填）</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="signature-source" placeholder="disk" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-auto">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">查詢</button>
            </div>
        </form>
        <div id="signature-result"></div>
    </div>
</section>

@* 自訂圖表（docs/HISTORY.md #6）：勾選狀態存 localStorage，預設全開 *@
<div class="modal fade lf-no-print" id="chart-picker-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title">自訂圖表</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="關閉"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body d-flex flex-column gap-2" id="chart-picker-body"></div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">關閉</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/lib/chartjs/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="~/js/pages/reports.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
